    <abstract>
      <para>
        &sles4sap; is the leading Linux platform for &hana;, &s4h;, and &netweaver;, and an
        Endorsed App by &sap;. Two of the key components of &productnameshort; are &sleha;
        (&slehaa;) and resource agents (RAs). &slehaa; provides &pace;, an open-source cluster
        framework. The resource agents manage automated failover of &hanasr;, &s4hana; ASCS/ERS,
        and &nwshort; ASCS/ERS.
      </para>
      <para>
        This document provides an overview of the &ha; solutions that &suse; supports for
        &hanasr; on &productnameshort; 15, using the <systemitem>SAPHanaSR</systemitem> and
        <systemitem>SAPHanaSR-ScaleOut</systemitem> resource agents. New solutions will be
        added when they become available.
      </para>
    </abstract>
